      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was looking at my dad’s old photos today and it just hit me. everything that went wrong with him, the way he just… gave up at the end, it’s all in my dna. i can feel it happening to me too. like i’m just a ticking time bomb waiting for my brain to finally break like theirs did. it feels like i'm just playing out a script that was written before i was even born.",
